{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>No panic! You don't need to know how assemble Rubik's cube.</strong></i><br><i><strong>We tried to make the game accessible to everyone.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/Villain.png?t=1746077604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The evil Obfus has disturbed the peace that has reigned in Cubindom for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate the faces of the Rubik's Cube to restore the usual order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the wonderful world and take a break from everyday activities. At the same time, Rubicon challenges those who are eager to test themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about your actions to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/gameplayEnC.png?t=1746077604\" />In the game you will face two types of levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cunning Obfus confused the brave knights and placed his dangerous henchmen to prevent them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help the brave warriors find their way to the tower.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/HeroEn.gif?t=1746077604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Envious Obfus violated the integrity of the castle walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Save the inhabitants from dangers by closing the walls of the same color in a line.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/CastleEn.gif?t=1746077604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/commandEnC.png?t=1746077604\" />This game was invented by a schoolboy, and implemented by a student with the help of people from various areas of game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have any questions, found translation inaccuracies or game bugs do not hesitate to contact us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will try to answer you promptly and solve the problems that have arisen.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2452790?t=1746077604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746077604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746077604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746077604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>No panic! You don't need to know how assemble Rubik's cube.</strong></i><br><i><strong>We tried to make the game accessible to everyone.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/Villain.png?t=1746077604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The evil Obfus has disturbed the peace that has reigned in Cubindom for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate the faces of the Rubik's Cube to restore the usual order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the wonderful world and take a break from everyday activities. At the same time, Rubicon challenges those who are eager to test themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think carefully about your actions to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/gameplayEnC.png?t=1746077604\" />In the game you will face two types of levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cunning Obfus confused the brave knights and placed his dangerous henchmen to prevent them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Help the brave warriors find their way to the tower.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/HeroEn.gif?t=1746077604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Envious Obfus violated the integrity of the castle walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Save the inhabitants from dangers by closing the walls of the same color in a line.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/CastleEn.gif?t=1746077604\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/extras/commandEnC.png?t=1746077604\" />This game was invented by a schoolboy, and implemented by a student with the help of people from various areas of game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have any questions, found translation inaccuracies or game bugs do not hesitate to contact us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will try to answer you promptly and solve the problems that have arisen.</p>","developers":["IgroMashina"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452790/header.jpg?t=1746077604","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257018255,